<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Discourse-Aware Dual-Track Streaming Response for 
<br class="ltx_break">Low-Latency Spoken Dialogue Systems</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
